SOAPBOX: Got set up Saturday morning, and had fun on 10M.
SOAPBOX: Had good propagation into Africa, working Namibia and ZD7. (Great to work
SOAPBOX: Gilbert (ZD7BG) after meeting him during the IARU.) Had propagation well after
SOAPBOX: the DX local sunset to Africa and Europe. Also good propagation to South
SOAPBOX: America for much of the daytime, and Japan rolled in after 21:00Z on Both
SOAPBOX: Saturday and Sunday. Had brief decodes from New Zealand and the Philippines,
SOAPBOX: but could not get them in the log.
SOAPBOX: Thanks to the stations that answered my CQs. Nice to call and work a few
SOAPBOX: stations, in addition to the S&P work.
SOAPBOX: 73 de N0UI
